WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:05,950
When did you learn it?

2
00:00:06,390 --> 00:00:15,030
There is no baby on our hike who can’t cook. The baby’s father will feed him.

3
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:22,830
How easy to cook

4
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,230
Just have the brains and hands to do it

5
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:26,390
Sometimes you can’t even find flat rocks in the mountains.

6
00:00:26,390 --> 00:00:27,790
I just cut the vegetables with my hands

7
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:34,080
Brother, I haven’t finished eating yet

8
00:00:34,740 --> 00:00:35,820
what do we do today

9
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:43,110
Whose father does the baby love the most?

10
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:45,430
Is it okay for daddy to cook for the baby that night?

11
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,380
You want to eat shoe boards, right?

12
00:00:57,720 --> 00:00:59,120
Brother, I'm full

13
00:00:59,120 --> 00:01:00,120
Change your clothes and leave
